# Frequency conversion between megahertz and terahertz

Verifies direct conversion between megahertz and terahertz in both directions. Megahertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion and four-place rounding, while terahertz converts exactly to megahertz.

>>> source
forward_whole: int = 1mhz
print(forward_whole->to(thz))
forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5mhz
print(forward_fractional->to(thz))
backward_whole: int = 1thz
print(backward_whole->to(mhz))
backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5thz
print(backward_fractional->to(mhz))

<<< stdout
0.0000thz
0.0000thz
1000000mhz
1500000.0mhz

<<< stderr
